"Balian Bawi": This is bad. This is bad. This is bad.
*the Balian murmurs to herself, repeating the words restlessly*
"Balian Bawi": Sira!
Sira: Balian... Do you see this fire going out any time soon?
"Balian Bawi": *shakes head*
"Balian Bawi": No... It's already spread too much.
"Balian Bawi": Why didn't I see this? Why...
Sira: ...